{"type":"npc","name":"Harrophage","folder":null,"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":500,"temp":0,"max":500,"details":"void healing"},"ac":{"value":42,"details":""},"allSaves":{"value":""},"speed":{"value":30,"otherSpeeds":[{"type":"fly","value":60}],"details":""},"immunities":[{"type":"death-effects","exceptions":[]},{"type":"disease","exceptions":[]},{"type":"paralyzed","exceptions":[]},{"type":"unconscious","exceptions":[]}],"weaknesses":[{"type":"vitality","value":10,"exceptions":[]}]},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":["common","necril","venenan"],"details":""},"level":{"value":20},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>Harrophages are eternal, undying horrors that arise in areas devastated by biological and chemical warfare. The souls of thousands of people who met agonizing deaths at the hands of diseases or choking gases are bound into the fragments of the weapons that killed them. These harbingers of ruin bring death wherever they go. Some harrophages travel to the lands of their enemies in war before engaging in the indiscriminate slaughter of soldiers and civilians alike. Others resent every living creature and seek to inflict suffering as broadly as they can.</p><p>Harrophages rarely form alliances with mortals, but they readily cooperate with fiends and undead to pursue their goals. Hordes of leukodaemons and omox demons eagerly rally under a harrophage's banner.</p><h2>Malice of the Crowd</h2><p>Billows of toxic gas compose a harrophage's body, within which the faces of individual spirits roil. These spirits, victims of long-gone atrocities, are rarely evil themselves, and many of them can conduct a conversation (though they have little awareness of events beyond their own deaths). Nevertheless, this collection of mostly benign spirits comes together to form a single collective mind, and that mind is unutterably and implacably evil.</p><h2>Suggested Monster Parts</h2><p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 8,750/17,500/30,000 gp</p><p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> weapons (piercing, slashing), armor (light), perception item, skill items (Acrobatics, Athletics, Deception, Intimidation, Medicine, Nature, Religion, Society)</p><p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> constitution, death, electricity, elongating, energy resistant (void), fire, fire shield, ice, music, poison, poisonous armor, sensory (darkvision), spells (Divine: @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.spells.jrBa9deU2ULFWvSl]{Falling Stars}, @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.spells.MlpbeZ61Euhl0d60]{Toxic Cloud}), strength, throwing, unholy, wild, winged</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Elemental Storm (Pathfinder)","authors":"Spencer Holmes","license":"ORC","remaster":true}},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":9},"dex":{"mod":3},"con":{"mod":11},"int":{"mod":5},"wis":{"mod":7},"cha":{"mod":7}},"perception":{"details":"","mod":33,"senses":[{"type":"darkvision"},{"type":"lifesense","acuity":"imprecise","range":120}],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":39,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":27,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":33,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"acrobatics":{"base":32},"athletics":{"base":38},"deception":{"base":34},"intimidation":{"base":38},"medicine":{"base":34},"nature":{"base":34},"religion":{"base":34},"society":{"base":34}},"traits":{"value":["undead","unholy"],"rarity":"rare","size":{"value":"lg"}}},"_id":"KlkCp1dJocJQVdnR","img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/portraits/harrophage.webp","prototypeToken":{"name":"Harrophage","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"width":2,"height":2,"texture":{"src":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/tokens/harrophage.webp","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"offsetX":0,"offsetY":0,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"rotation":0,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotati