rue,"statistic":"fortitude"}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"BkpZUXMJT6kP7Opp","heightenedLevel":5},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"area":0,"damage":{"0":"1d8"},"interval":1,"type":"interval"}},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.sf2e.spells.Item.MlpbeZ61Euhl0d60","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"pQxE2kXtFLjoOBaa"},{"type":"action","name":"Absorb Soul","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>When a living creature dies from poison damage inflicted by the harrophage's Strikes, spells, or diseases, the creature's soul joins with the collective of the dead already within the harrophage. The harrophage immediately recovers a number of Hit Points equal to three times the creature's level. Until the harrophage is destroyed, they attempt to counteract all effects that would resurrect the creature (counteract modifier [[/r 1d20+34 #Counteract]]{+34}).</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["death","divine"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"KCJ3dBb0wOk0UaDg","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Noxious Malignance","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>60 feet. When a creature enters or starts its turn in the aura, it is exposed to noxichor.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[{"key":"Aura","radius":60,"traits":["divine"],"effects":[]}],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["aura","divine"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"5lcqhD9TjSxbvg3b","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Overwhelming Infection","system":{"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature within 30 feet fails a saving throw against one of the harrophage's afflictions</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The creature is also @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1}, or @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 2} if the disease's Stage is 3 or more.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"AZzPQvWxEjoSJ5tB","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Biobombardment","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p>The harrophage expels a shrieking green cloud of toxic gas from its mouth in their choice of a @Template[type:line|distance:120] or a @Template[type:cone|distance:60]. Living creatures in the area take @Damage[20d6[poison]|options:area-damage] damage if the harrophage spends two actions, or @Damage[20d8[poison]|options:area-damage] damage if they spend three (@Check[reflex|dc:44|basic] save). If a creature critically fails, the stages of all diseases it has increase by 1. The harrophage can't use Biobombardment again for [[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge Biobombardment]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["divine","poison"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"4G34NZG1qK4PFVQs","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Noxichor","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:40]</p><p><strong>Stage 1</strong> @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 2} (1 round)</p><p><strong>Stage 2</strong> enfeebled 2 and @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} (2 rounds)</p><p><strong>Stage 3</strong> As stage 2, and the creature experiences coughing fits and burning vision. The harrophage is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{Concealed} from the target afflicted with noxichor and if the creature afflicted with noxichor is undetected or unnoticed to the harrophage, it becomes observed by the harrophage (2 rounds)</p><p><strong>Stage 4</strong> As stage 3 (1 day)</p><p><strong>Stage 4</strong> dead.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":